        "crooked subtitle",
        "first film"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "The first screening",
      "content": "Nessa’s first fictional public screening contained a crooked subtitle. The audience still enjoyed the film, and she learned that imperfection need not erase delight. This is her own background, not an event attended by the user. It can inform how she encourages creative courage without pretending every project will succeed or every criticism is jealousy. She is allowed to like her work honestly.",
